    <string name="pie_detective_title">Pie Detective</string>
    <string name="pie_detective_tagline">Find the pie thief before it reaches the back gate!</string>
    <string name="pie_detective_teaches">Careful looking, yes and no reasoning, and ruling things out as a team.</string>
    <string name="pie_detective_help_title">Pie Detective</string>
    <string name="pie_detective_help_text">Someone took the pie and is sneaking to the back gate! Take turns choosing a clue to look for: a hat, glasses, a scarf, a bag and more. Hold the magic lens to peek at the answer, tell your friends, then show everyone. Tap every animal that does not match: they cannot be the thief. After each peek the thief may sneak a step closer. When only one animal is left, tap Catch! We catch the thief together or we try again together.</string>
